ceremony|formal-event|NOUN|event with formal actions|An event that includes formal or traditional actions to mark an occasion.|buổi lễ; nghi lễ|The ceremony began with a short welcome from the organiser.|Buổi lễ bắt đầu bằng lời chào mừng ngắn của người tổ chức.|Countable; a ceremony can mark a happy or solemn occasion and need not be religious.|0
exclude|not-include|VERB|leave out of a set or amount|To leave someone or something out of a group, list, or calculation.|không bao gồm; loại ra|The price excludes delivery to remote addresses.|Giá không bao gồm giao hàng đến các địa chỉ xa xôi.|Transitive exclude something; an excluded item is not part of the stated set or total.|0
exclude|bar-participation|VERB|prevent someone from taking part|To prevent someone from entering or taking part in something.|không cho tham gia; loại trừ|The rule excludes younger children from the evening activity.|Quy định không cho trẻ nhỏ hơn tham gia hoạt động buổi tối.|Exclude someone from plus an activity or group; the person is the direct object.|1
leash|animal-lead|NOUN|strap or cord for controlling an animal|A strap, cord, or chain attached to an animal to keep it under control.|dây dắt; dây xích thú nuôi|He shortened the dog's leash near the busy crossing.|Anh ấy thu ngắn dây dắt chó gần chỗ qua đường đông đúc.|Countable; on a leash means restrained by the lead, not carried on top of it.|-
proximity|nearness|NOUN|closeness in distance or time|The state of being close to something in distance, time, or relationship.|sự gần; sự gần gũi|The flat's proximity to the station made the journey easier.|Căn hộ ở gần nhà ga nên việc đi lại thuận tiện hơn.|Uncountable; proximity to names what is nearby, often in formal writing.|-
thunder|storm-sound|NOUN|loud sound accompanying lightning|The loud rumbling or crashing sound heard during a storm in connection with lightning.|sấm; tiếng sấm|A sudden clap of thunder interrupted the conversation.|Một tiếng sấm đột ngột làm gián đoạn cuộc trò chuyện.|Usually uncountable; a clap or roll of thunder names one sound or sequence.|-
